.TH FSYNC 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
fsync \- synchronize file data and metadata
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B int fsync(int descriptor);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Flushes modified file data and associated metadata to stable storage.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns zero, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fdatasync (3crunch),
.BR fsync (2)
